      "children": []
    },
    "b-70-harness-model-app-harnesses-embed-the-4": {
      "id": "b-70-harness-model-app-harnesses-embed-the-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "App harnesses embed the kernel as a service inside a product (session stores,\nSSE, viewers). The terminal harness is the opposite trade: it borrows pi's\nexisting front-end: loop, streaming, tools, transcript, and only supplies\nwhat pi cannot: find the bundle, assemble the request, bind its tools."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
